            "question": "What's different about the Wide Wheels Edition vs. the standard 4WD?",
            "answer": "<p>Wide wheels in place of the standard set, raising the slope rating from 75% (37°) to 85% (40°) and spreading the mower's weight over a larger contact area to reduce turf damage.</p>",
